				<name>Dorsey Center</name>
				<description>Location and Mailing Address: 
6810 Deerpath Road Suite 200
Elkridge, Maryland 21075 


From I-95 North or South: Exit I-95 towards Route 100 east. Exit Route 100 towards Route 1 South. On Route 1, move to inside lane. At first light, turn left onto Dorsey Road (Route 103). After about 1/3 mile on Dorsey Road, turn left onto Douglas Legum Drive. Once on Douglas Legum Drive, the JHU/Dorsey Center is on the second floor on the 5-story white building with blue windows.

From I-295 (Baltimore Washington Parkway) North or South: Exit I-295 towards Route 100 West. Exit Route 100 using the Coca-Cola Drive exit. Turn left onto Coca-Cola Drive towards Dorsey Road. At the end of Coca-Cola Drive, turn right onto Dorsey Road. After about 1 mile on Dorsey Road, turn right onto Douglas Legum Drive. Once on Douglas Legum Drive, the JHU/Dorsey Center is on the second floor on the 5-story white building with blue windows.</description>
