The Columbia Center&apos;s location in the Baltimore/Washington corridor allows the school to meet the educational needs of students in Howard County and the Greater Washington/Baltimore area. Credit and noncredit programs are offered by the Graduate Division of Business and Management, the Graduate Division of Education, the Division of Undergraduate Studies, and the Division of Public Safety Leadership, as well as by the Evergreen Society.</description>
